{
  "$comment": "Pascal: begin/end blocks after then and do, := assignment with = as equality, div and mod, var declarations with a type and no value, a bare begin..end. main block, case-insensitive keywords and identifiers, curly-brace and paren-star comments. Loaded at run time from langs/extras/. Counted for loops and functions are omitted because their shapes differ from the kernel's; everything listed is Pascal.",
